(footprint "SameSky_RCJ-02_RCA_Jack"
	(version 20240108)
	(generator "manual")
	(generator_version "9.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Same Sky (formerly CUI Devices) RCJ-02 series RCA jack, through-hole, panel-mount. 2 electrical contacts: pad 1 = signal (center pin), pad 2 = shield/ground (both mounting feet). PCB layout from datasheet page 2: one 1.70 mm signal hole at origin; two 2.00 mm mounting-foot holes at (+/-5.15, +1.60) mm both wired to pad 2 (they share the shield net internally). Connector body extends in the -Y direction from the pin row -- barrel opening faces away from the mounting feet. Ordering options: RCJ-02-1 (black), -2 (red), -3 (white), -4 (yellow), -5 (blue), -6 (green), -7 (orange). Datasheet: Documentation/Components/RCA_Connector.pdf.")
